tools/canonical-model/model/unified-model-0.12.md:114:- Providers: coverage is kept per (tenant, system), each with its provider: AIMS, the coverage rotation; N-OC, the mirror, whose live days count as covered only while its last completed cycle is younger than T3 (a stalled mirror uncovers them); days before the mirror's history depth are not_applicable; the synthetic seed declares coverage over the whole window relative to its play clock (days outside the tape covered-empty, stated). For legality, not_applicable and no row are uncovered for any metric whose reach crosses them (lens 2 M9).
